{"id": "EUVD-2026-108334", "enisaUuid": "73b5a405-2224-3a70-8ab9-9ad88f337288", "description": "Ghidra before 12.2 contains a resource allocation without limits vulnerability in FileSystemIndexHelper used by TarFileSystem and ZipFileSystem, which store unbounded archive entries. Attackers can persuade a user to open or batch-import a crafted TAR or ZIP archive with excessive entries to exhaust the Java heap and hang the session.", "datePublished": "2026-10-22T19:14:03", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-22T19:14:03", "baseScore": 6.8, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/NationalSecurityAgency/ghidra/security/advisories/GHSA-vvp8-22p8-x954", "https://github.com/NationalSecurityAgency/ghidra/commit/061ec06a79f4147267f6fc690b0dcf944b2d4957", "https://github.com/NationalSecurityAgency/ghidra/releases/tag/Ghidra_12.2_build", "https://github.com/NationalSecurityAgency/ghidra", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/ghidra-before-12.2-denial-of-service-via-tar-and-zip-file-system-mount"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-115398", "GHSA-xj66-h4r7-jmmx"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1785e4df-f542-3df1-aeb2-de4b5c1e3a08", "product": {"name": "Ghidra", "vendor": {"name": "NSA"}}, "product_version": "0 <12.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "82cd822b-2422-3945-b290-d8839ee89578", "vendor": {"name": "NationalSecurityAgency"}}], "isExploited": false}